{"t": 1794114110.2912712, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"body": "Implemented the agreed fix in `checkout.promo.normalize_code`.\n\n**Change:** codes are now normalised before lookup: surrounding whitespace stripped, inner whitespace removed, and upper-cased (`\" autumn 24 \"` -> `\"AUTUMN24\"`).\n\n```python\ndef normalize_code(code: str) -> str:\n    return \"\".join(code.split()).upper()\n```\n\nVerified locally against the failing input from Sentry (CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q, `PromoNotFound: code ' autumn24 ' does not exist`) and variants: `' autumn24 '`, `'autumn 24'`, `' Autumn 24 '` all normalise to `'AUTUMN24'`.", "issue_key": "PAY-618"}, "ok": true}
